73..144 Comment "//! Each composite reads its endpoint type from the reflexivity binder."
145..212 Comment "//! The pathological twin refuses a composite that lacks this type."
213..216 Comment "//!"
217..277 Comment "//! The checker reads the composite type from both operands."
278..329 Comment "//! The kernel replays each composite at that type."
330..333 Comment "//!"
